          "title": "0.170.0",
          "url": "https://github.com/openai/codex/releases/tag/rust-v0.170.0",
          "source": "GitHub Release: openai/codex",
          "summary": "<h2>New Features</h2> <ul> <li>Added WebRTC negotiation for realtime voice calls in the TUI. (<a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"6357685721\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/openai/codex/issues/61172\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/openai/codex/pull/61172/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/openai/codex/pull/61172\">#61172</a>)</li> <li>Added automatically refreshed authentication headers for OpenTelemetry HTTP exporters. (<a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"6343445695\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/openai/codex/issues/61028\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/openai/codex/pull/61028/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/openai/codex/pull/61028\">#61028</a>)</li> <li>Added experimental support for using identically named MCP servers across environments. (<a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"6339210232\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/openai/codex/issues/60905\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/openai/codex/pull/60905/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/openai/codex/pull/60905\">#60905</a>)</li> </ul> <h2>Bug Fixes</h2> <ul> <li>Oversized WebSocket requests now fall back to HTTP without unnecessary retries. (<a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"6335253805\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/openai/codex/issues/60840\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/openai/codex/pull/60840/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/openai/codex/pull/60840\">#60840</a>, <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"6335263304\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/openai/codex/issues/60841\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/openai/codex/pull/60841/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/openai/codex/pull/60841\">#60841</a>)</li> <li>Fixed MCP OAuth credential races during cancellation, login, and logout. (<a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"6335577102\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/openai/codex/issues/60849\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/openai/codex/pull/60849/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/openai/codex/pull/60849\">#60849</a>, <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"6341654512\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/openai/codex/issues/60981\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/openai/codex/pull/60981/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/openai/codex/pull/60981\">#60981</a>)</li> <li>Improved automatic reconnection for Cloud conversations and preserved active recovery turns when clients reconnect. (<a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"6340940153\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/openai/codex/issues/60969\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/openai/codex/pull/60969/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/openai/codex/pull/60969\">#60969</a>, <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"6342706645\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/openai/codex/issues/61014\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/openai/codex/pull/61014/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/openai/codex/pull/61014\">#61014</a>)</li> <li>Fixed Windows file replacement, sandbox permission preservation, and runtime registration recovery. (<a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"6338353971\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/openai/codex/issues/60872\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/openai/codex/pull/60872/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/openai/codex/pull/60872\">#60872</a>, <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"6339832557\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/openai/codex/issues/60943\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/openai/codex/pull/60943/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/openai/codex/pull/60943\">#60943</a>, <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"6339839045\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/openai/codex/issues/60944\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/openai/codex/pull/60944/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/openai/codex/pull/60944\">#60944</a>)</li> <li>Fixed permission updates and child threads losing existing sandbox restrictions. (<a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"6339657968\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/openai/codex/issues/60936\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/openai/codex/pull/60936/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/openai/codex/pull/60936\">#60936</a>, <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"6352033009\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/openai/codex/issues/61134\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/openai/codex/pull/61134/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/openai/codex/pull/61134\">#61134</a>)</li> <li>Removed duplicate file search results and fixed thread search snippets for queries containing whitespace. (<a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"6335538941\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/openai/codex/issues/60845\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/openai/codex/pull/60845/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/openai/codex/pull/60845\">#60845</a>, <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"6335559525\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/openai/codex/issues/60846\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/openai/codex/pull/60846/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/openai/codex/pull/60846\">#60846</a>)</li> </ul> <h2>Documentation</h2> <ul> <li>Updated sandbox documentation to explain permission profiles and filesystem rules. (<a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"6351825557\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/openai/codex/issues/61133\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/openai/codex/pull/61133/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/openai/codex/pull/61133\">#61133</a>)</li> </ul> <h2>Changelog</h2> <p>Full Changelog: <a class=\"commit-link\" href=\"https://github.com/openai/codex/compare/rust-v0.169.0...rust-v0.170.0\"><tt>rust-v0.169.0...rust-v0.170.0</tt></a></p> <ul> <li><a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"6325805787\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/openai/codex/issues/60770\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/openai/codex/pull/60770/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/openai/codex/pull/60770\">#60770</a> Derive history and notes tool schemas from typed requests <a class=\"user-mention notranslate\" data-hovercard-type=\"user\" data-hovercard-url=\"/users/euroelessar/hovercard\" data-octo-click=\"hovercard-link-